 "header": [
  "The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, its regular play of about 2.5 minutes: the launcher, Load",
  "ROM on a new profile once the shader list Chrome builds behind it is done (Firefox builds none there and says so), Start",
  "Game, then Start (Enter) held 400 ms every 5 s through the legal screen, the logos, the title, New Game, the",
  "difficulty, the Rumble Pak notice and the opening scene to the character choice, Danielle and her scene, into the",
  "Breach, the first level, as a player does. The plan's waits are the browser's time: nothing tells it where the game",
  "is, so a press that comes while the game loads waits for the next. The play is 70 s in the Breach: three sways out",
  "and back about the spot the level starts on, walking (the C buttons, W and S), strafing (A and D), turning (the stick,",
  "the arrows) and firing (Z, Left Ctrl), with the pause menu opened and closed (Start, Enter) after the second.",
  "With --pad its padKeys are the pad buttons this game gives its keys (src/game/config.cpp): Left Ctrl is Z, the right",
  "trigger; Tab is L, North; E is A, the right shoulder; Q is B, the left."
